<title>CHILE: TENNIS-CHILEAN ATP MEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CHILEAN ATP MEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-11-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the Hellmann's</p>
<p>Cup ATP men's tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Semi-finals</p>
<p>1-Marcelo Rios (Chile) beat 3-Alberto Berasategui (Spain) 6-2</p>
<p>6-4.</p>
<p>4-Hernan Gumy (Argentina) beat 2-Felix Mantilla (Spain) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-1) 3-6 6-3.</p>
</text>
